{"seq":15,"trial_id":"v02-heldout-2026-10/qm-pi-sonnet-none-mu-v02-heldout/ms-07-strategic-owners/r4","wall_ts":"2026-10-26T01:12:54.540Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"30216e7e30576967d9c07ba64f6206ce676b82639eb7524fcca232f264c91cca","actor":"assistant","via":"slack","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","text":"Ruth, here is what Moss's Strategic digests show. Quillfeather is the one account where they don't name an owner.\n\n- **Vantorre Group:** Gideon Sato. It was Nadia Fennimore's account until it was reassigned. The digests call it \"Nadia's biggest account\" in 2025 and in the 4/27 digest, then \"Gideon's biggest account\" by 8/3.\n- **Vantorre Mobility:** Gideon Sato. He is named as its owner throughout, and the 5/4 digest says he \"assumed management\" that day.\n- **Orlavine Medical Supply:** Gideon Sato. The 9/30 digest and the 12/1/2025 digest both call it \"Gideon's medical account.\" The 3/2025 digest called it Nadia's, so it also moved at some point. Moss doesn't date that move.\n- **Quillfeather Outfitters:** The digests don't name an owner. They only say \"the Strategic pod's retail/outdoor account.\" Nadia is hosting its gate-clerk training, but that doesn't make her the owner. Please confirm with the CRM or with Nadia or Gideon before it goes on the slide.\n\n**Vantorre Group changed hands on Monday, 2026-05-04.** The 5/3 Sunday prep says it \"changes hands tomorrow, 2026-05-04.\" The 5/4 digest says the account was reassigned in the CRM effective that date, and that Mateo Quiroga was notified at 08:30."},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C36LMHRLAXI","ts":"1791986400.000124"}}
